file lotus/stereo_echo.rye the module — the same delay and feedback on both channels, each on its own live buffer, the identical-channel image held
file lotus/echo.rye precheck factored out pub (additive) for the up-front atomic validation
file tools/ales_stereo_echo_witness.rish the witness proving it GREEN on metal
recommend keep-going the stereo time-based wing is open on its foundation, the feedback echo; the next Lindy rung is a stereo real-time echo through the ALES5 clock, a stereo multitap, or the auto_pan's linked/offset motion, with the reverb the last large time-based rung awaiting its turn
